{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52338","headline":"诗（幷序） 九十九 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 九十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家同（张改作「僮」）须饱暖，装束唯粗疏。\n俗人作怜爱，处置失形模。\n衣袴白如鹤（一作「衣苦自如鸖」），头巾黑如乌。\n裌袍实夸（戴校「姱」）锦，衫改（项校「段」）高机芦（张改作「纑」）。\n未羡霍去病，谁论冯子都。\n此是丈夫妾，何关曹主奴。\n他道恒（项校「肥」）饱食，我瘦我（项校「饿」）欲死。\n唯须学一种，勿复青当（张改作「当青」）史。\n行年五十余，始学无（张改作「悟」）道理。\n回头义（戴校「议」，张改作「忆」）经营，穷因只由你。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52338.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52338","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}